  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nBrutal top-down loot shooter. Similar games can be counted on one hand, as action games typically fall into the first-person or third-person perspective genres.<p></p>\n<p>You are a CyberCorp fighter. In your hands lies a unique and dangerous technology – the Synth, a remotely controlled combat shell.</p>\n<p>Are you ready to take your weapon and return order to the streets of the city?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flexible progression system – Upgrade your equipment using a card-based system of weapon and armor enhancements. Build and customize to match your playstyle.\n</li><li>Multiplayer – Play story and side missions with friends or random players. Equip smart and make builds for multiplauer combos.\n</li><li>Slums, factories, laboratories, elite residential complex – Complete missions in various locations, explore the city of the future. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of cyberpunk.\n</li><li>Fast paced gameplay – Defend objects, hack security systems, capture control points, and uncover hidden items.\n</li><li>Loot shooter – Choose your difficulty level and get the rewards. There’s something for those who seek a more casual experience or a hardcore challenge.\n</li><li>Procedural level generation – Map, enemies, loot, encounters, weather, boss, reward are all randomized each run.\n</li></ul>\n",
